# reCAPTCHA v3 secret key (optional) — verifies tokens on the public
# Cloud Functions (submitQuestionnaire, submitSignature). Leave empty to
# skip reCAPTCHA verification. Create keys at
# https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin
# Copy this file to functions/.env and fill in the value.
RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=
# Bank of Israel policy-rate feed, read by fetchBoiRates. Optional — the
# function falls back to the built-in default when this is unset.
#
# The feed's address has changed format before (the legacy page_*.aspx
# endpoint vs. the SDMX series database under FusionEdgeServer/sdmx/v2),
# and functions/src/boiParse.ts reads both. So if "רענן מבנק ישראל" starts
# reporting a 404 or "לא נמצאה ריבית בתשובה", set the new address here and
# redeploy — no code change:
#
#   firebase deploy --only functions:fetchBoiRates
BOI_RATES_URL=
